      "a": 3,
      "s": "<p>13.(d) ‘she has fever’→‘ks qi si’<br/>‘has he that shirt’ →‘dur ou tu ka’<br/>As has is common in both the code and corresponding to that ‘ka’ is given so ‘has’ is coded as ‘ka’</p>"
